    <p class="scrawl kicker">Straight from the North Pole.</p>
    <div class="faq">
      <details><summary>How does Santa decide who's naughty or nice?</summary><p>Santa looks at public records from the last 3 years, like B Corp certification, regulator cases and fines, and it's always about the company, not a single product. Not enough evidence never means naughty.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Does my vote change the Santa Score?</summary><p>No. Santa decides from the evidence 🎅. Your vote is the elves' view, shown next to it so everyone can see what other shoppers think.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is it watching me?</summary><p>No. It only runs on the shops on our list, and it only sends that shop's web address to look it up. No browsing history and no account. <a href="/privacy">Privacy notice</a>.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Think we've got a shop wrong?</summary><p>Email help@build40for40.com with a source and we'll check it twice.</p></details>
